---
title: Sequence Approve Donation with Central Sync
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff / Branch Admin / System Admin
    participant FE as Frontend Admin
    participant API as Backend API
    participant RBAC as JWT + RBAC
    participant SH as Branch Shard
    participant SYNC as Sync Worker
    participant CDB as Central Server

    Staff->>FE: Chon verified hoac rejected
    FE->>API: PATCH /api/donations/:id/status
    API->>RBAC: Kiem tra role va branchCode
    RBAC-->>API: Cho phep
    API->>SH: Update donation status
    SH-->>API: Updated
    API->>SYNC: Dong bo thay doi len trung tam
    SYNC->>CDB: Cap nhat bao cao tong hop / audit / monitoring
    CDB-->>SYNC: Success
    API-->>FE: 200 OK
